{
  "HAG.1": {
    "id": "HAG.1",
    "number": "1",
    "bookId": "HAG",
    "reference": "Hagai 1",
    "copyright": "Biblica® Ochiw Thuolo Motingʼo Loko Manyien™ Weg Loko © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 otim gi Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open New Luo Translation™ Copyright © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" en sai mondik mongorore e piny Amerika kendo en kido moyie malongʼo e ofis Biblica, Inc. Itiyo kode gi thuolo moa kuom Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
    "verseCount": 15,
    "content": [
      {
        "name": "chapter",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "number": "1",
          "style": "c",
          "sid": "HAG 1"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "1",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "s1"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Ojiw jo-Israel mondo oger hekalu",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "1",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 1:1"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "1",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Kane ochopo chiengʼ mokwongo mar dwe mar auchiel, e higa mar ariyo mar loch ruoth Darius, Jehova Nyasaye nowuoyo gi dho janabi Hagai ne Zerubabel wuod Shealtiel, mane jatend piny Juda, gi Joshua wuod Jehozadak, jadolo maduongʼ kowacho niya,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.1.1",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.1.1"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "2",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 1:2"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "2",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Jehova Nyasaye Maratego wacho niya, \"Ogendinigi wacho ni, 'Kinde pok ochopo monego gerne Nyasaye hekalu mare.' \"",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.1.2",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.1.2"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "3",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 1:3"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "3",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Eka wach Jehova Nyasaye nobiro gi dwond janabi Hagai kawacho niya:",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.1.3",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.1.3"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "4",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 1:4"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "4",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "\"Bende en gima ber adier ka un uwegi udakie uteu mugero mabeyo, to hekalu marani to omukore machal kama?\"",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.1.4",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.1.4"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "5",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 1:5"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "5",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Ma emomiyo Jehova Nyasaye Maratego wacho niya, \"Nonuru timbeu.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.1.5",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.1.5"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "6",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 1:6"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "6",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Usechwoyo mangʼeny, to ukayo mana matin; uchiemo, to gima uchamo ok nyal yiengʼou, umetho, to ok romu; urwakoru gi lewni, to onge kata ngʼato achiel kuomu mayudo liet; to nyaka un joma nwangʼo chudo, bangʼ ka unwangʼo chudo to uketo mana ei ofuku motuch.\"",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.1.6",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.1.6"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "7",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 1:7"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "7",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Jehova Nyasaye Maratego wacho niya, \"Nonuru timbeu.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.1.7",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.1.7"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "8",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 1:8"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "8",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Idh-uru udhi e gode mondo ukel yien ugernago ot manyalo morgo, kama duongʼna maler nyalo nenoree,\" Jehova Nyasaye owacho.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.1.8",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.1.8"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "9",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 1:9"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "9",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "\"Usegombo yudo mangʼeny, to osetamore ma uyudo mana matin; to kata mana mano mago ma usechoko mukeloe dala, abiro kudho oko. Mani notimore nikech angʼo?\" Jehova Nyasaye Maratego penjo. \"Nikech hekaluna ma uweyo odongʼ gunda, ka un uwegi to uringo kudhi e uteu molos mabeyo.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.1.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.1.9"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "10",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 1:10"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "10",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Mano emomiyo koro Polo malo ok nyal miyou koth kata matin, kendo piny osiko mana kotwo ma ok nyal nyago gimoro.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.1.10",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.1.10"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "11",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 1:11"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "11",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Mano emomiyo osehononu oro mondo otwo piny kaachiel gi gode, mi cham gi mzabibu kod mo zeituni, gi gik moko duto ma piny nyago ner, mondo kech omak dhano gi jamni, kendo oketh tije duto ma dhano oloso.\"",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.1.11",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.1.11"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "b"
        },
        "items": []
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "12",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 1:12"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "12",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Eka Zerubabel ma wuod Shealtiel kod Joshua wuod Jehozadak, ma jadolo maduongʼ, kaachiel gi ji mamoko mane oa e twech, kane giwinjo weche Nyasaye gi weche mag janabi Hagai, kaka Jehova Nyasaye ne oore, luoro maduongʼ nomakogi e nyim Ruoth.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.1.12",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.1.12"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "13",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 1:13"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "13",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Eka Hagai jaote mar Jehova Nyasaye, nowuoyo kod ji konyisogi weche mane Jehova Nyasaye omiye, kowacho niya, \"An kodu,\" Jehova Nyasaye owacho.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.1.13",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.1.13"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "14",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 1:14"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "14",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Eka Jehova Nyasaye nojiwo chuny Zerubabel wuod Shealtiel mane jatend piny Juda, chuny Joshua, kod chuny joma moko mane oa e twech. Negibiro kendo gichako tich e od Jehova Nyasaye Maratego ma Nyasachgi,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.1.14",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.1.14"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "15",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 1:15"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "15",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "tarik piero ariyo gangʼwen e dwe mar auchiel e higa mar ariyo mar loch Ruoth Darius.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.1.15",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.1.15"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "next": {
      "id": "HAG.2",
      "number": "2",
      "bookId": "HAG"
    },
    "previous": {
      "id": "HAG.intro",
      "number": "intro",
      "bookId": "HAG"
    }
  },
  "HAG.2": {
    "id": "HAG.2",
    "number": "2",
    "bookId": "HAG",
    "reference": "Hagai 2",
    "copyright": "Biblica® Ochiw Thuolo Motingʼo Loko Manyien™ Weg Loko © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 otim gi Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open New Luo Translation™ Copyright © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" en sai mondik mongorore e piny Amerika kendo en kido moyie malongʼo e ofis Biblica, Inc. Itiyo kode gi thuolo moa kuom Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
    "verseCount": 23,
    "content": [
      {
        "name": "chapter",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "number": "2",
          "style": "c",
          "sid": "HAG 2"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "2",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "s1"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Duongʼ mar hekalu",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "1",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:1"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "1",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Tarik piero ariyo gachiel e dwe mar abiriyo, wach Jehova Nyasaye nobiro kokalo kuom janabi Hagai kawacho niya:",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.1",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.1"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "2",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:2"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "2",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "\"Wuo kod Zerubabel wuod Shealtiel, ma en jatend Juda kaachiel gi Joshua wuod Jehozadak ma jadolo maduongʼ kod joma notony moa e twech. Penjgi niya,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.2",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.2"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "3",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:3"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "3",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "'En ngʼa modongʼ e dieru mane oneno hekaluni kapod nigi duongʼne machon? Koro sani to uneno kochal nade? Donge ochalonu mana ka gima nono?'",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.3",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.3"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "4",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:4"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "4",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Jehova Nyasaye wacho ni, 'Bed motegno, yaye Zerubabel. Bed motegno, yaye Joshua wuod Jehozadak, ma jadolo maduongʼ.' Jehova Nyasaye medo wacho ni, 'Beduru motegno, un ji duto modak e pinyni kendo tiuru matek nimar an kodu,' Jehova Nyasaye Maratego owacho.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.4",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.4"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "5",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:5"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "5",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "'Ma e gima ne asingorae kodu kane uwuok e piny Misri. Kendo Roho mara nikodu kinde duto. Kik ubed maluor.'",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.5",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.5"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "6",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:6"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "6",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "\"Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye Maratego wacho, 'Pod odongʼ mana kinde matin, abiro chako yiengo kendo polo kod piny, gi nam, kaachiel gi piny motwo;",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.6",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.6"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "7",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:7"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "7",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "bende abiro yiengo ogendini duto, ma ginikel mwandugi duto, kendo abiro pongʼo hekaluni gi duongʼ.' An Jehova Nyasaye Maratego ema awacho kamano.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.7",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.7"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "8",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:8"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "8",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "'Fedha gi dhahabu gin maga,' Jehova Nyasaye Maratego owacho.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.8",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.8"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "9",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:9"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "9",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "'Duongʼ ma hekaluni biro bedogo achien, biro loyo mano mane en godo mokwongo,' Jehova Nyasaye Maratego owacho. 'Anakel kwe gi mwandu kae,' Jehova Nyasaye Maratego owacho.\"",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.9"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "s1"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Gweth mosing ni joma orito singruok",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "10",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:10"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "10",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Kane ochopo tarik piero ariyo gangʼwen e higa mar ariyo mar loch Darius, wach Jehova Nyasaye nobiro gi dwond janabi Hagai kawacho niya:",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.10",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.10"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "11",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:11"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "11",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "\"Jehova Nyasaye Maratego wacho ni, 'Penj jodolo mondo odwoki gima chik wacho:",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.11",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.11"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "12",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:12"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "12",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Ka ngʼato oketo ringʼo mowal ni Nyasaye e riak nangane, ma riak nanganeno ogere kuom makati, kata kuom kado, kata kuom divai, kata kuom mo, kata ei chiemo moro amora, to koro gima ogere kuomeno bende inyalo walo ni tich Nyasaye?' \"",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.12",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.12"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p",
          "vid": "HAG 2:12"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Jodolo nodwoko niya, \"Mano ok kamano.\"",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.12",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.12"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "13",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:13"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "13",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Eka Hagai nowacho niya, \"Ka ngʼato omulo ringre ngʼat motho, makoro obedo mogak, eka bangʼe ngʼatni ogere kuom gimoro, koro gino bende bedo mogak?\"",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.13",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.13"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p",
          "vid": "HAG 2:13"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Jodolo nodwoke niya, \"Obedo mogak.\"",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.13",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.13"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "14",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:14"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "14",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Eka Hagai nowacho niya, \" 'Jehova Nyasaye wacho ni: Mano bende e kaka jo-Israel kod gik moko duto ma giwachona ei hekaluni ogak.'",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.14",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.14"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "15",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:15"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "15",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "\" 'Koro paruru anena gima biro timore chakre kawuono, kane pok uchako gero hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye to ne ochalo nade?",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.15",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.15"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "16",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:16"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "16",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Donge kata kane ngʼato obiro iru ka ukayo cham koparo ni onyalo yudo ogunde piero ariyo, to oyudo apar kende? Kendo kane obiro kar biyo divai, koparo ni onyalo yudo chupni piero abich, to ne oyudo mana piero ariyo kende.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.16",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.16"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "17",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:17"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "17",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Chambu duto ne aketho gi dera kod pe, to kata bangʼ timo magi to pod ne udagi duogo ira,' Jehova Nyasaye owacho.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.17",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.17"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "18",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:18"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "18",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "'Paruru ahinya kochakore kawuono tarik piero ariyo gangʼwen mar dwe mar ochiko, ma en odiechiengʼ mane oketie mise mar hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.18",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.18"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "19",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:19"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "19",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Bende nitiere kodhi ma pod ni ei dero? Nyaka kawuononi mzabibu gi ngʼowu gi olemo mongʼinore kod zeituni pod ok nyag olemo.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.19",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.19"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p",
          "vid": "HAG 2:19"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "\" 'Chakre kawuono abiro olo gwethna kuomu.' \"",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.19",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.19"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "s1"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye ni Zerubabel",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "20",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:20"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "20",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Wach mar Jehova Nyasaye nobiro nyadiriyo ni janabi Hagai chiengʼ tarik piero ariyo gangʼwen mar dweno:",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.20",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.20"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "21",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:21"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "21",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "\"Wachne Zerubabel ma jatend Juda ni, 'Abiro yiengo polo gi piny.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.21",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.21"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "22",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:22"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "22",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Abiro loko loch mag ruodhi; kendo abiro ketho teko mag pinje mamoko, abiro goyo geche mag lweny piny, kaachiel gi joma oidhogi. Ngʼato ka ngʼato biro kedo gi owadgi, kendo farese kod joma oidhogi nonegi.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.22",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.22"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "23",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "HAG 2:23"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "23",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "\" 'E odiechiengno, anakawi in Zerubabel wuod Shealtiel ma jatichna kendo anaketi ibed ruodh jogo, nikech in ema sani koro aseyieri.' Jehova Nyasaye Maratego ema owacho.\"",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "HAG.2.23",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "HAG.2.23"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
